&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:63pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;"&gt;２．&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;税務上の繰越欠損金及びその繰延税金資産の繰越期限別の金額&lt;/span&gt;
